        "PMC10706897::web::028::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "WC particles and secondary carbides provide nucleation sites for protective oxide layers.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Second-phase strengthening by hard WC and carbide phases contributes to improved wear resistance.",
